 energy are not refunded and the dated report persists under ordinary record rules; the item follows existing ownership/death rules, never remote return. No persistent escrow, passive work or maintenance. During actual inspection permit only ordinary nondamaging viewing and gentle reorientation, leaving the same specimen at its actual site. Record only visible exterior shape, color, texture, visible damage, openings and exposed material that the physical implementation can genuinely resolve. Approximate scale must identify its reference and uncertainty; no inferred exact mass or dimension. Distinguish observed shell-like covering from confirmed internal anatomy. Interior observation is permitted only through an already present, genuinely visible opening without widening, peeling, breaking or separating it. Unimplemented or occluded features are explicitly unavailable, never null fields translated into healthy, intact, edible or unsafe. Handoff must implement a bounded direct-observation adapter where absent, not fabricate hidden anatomy or make a label-based safety lookup. If only access or coverage limits are demonstrable, the paid report records those limits and leaves condition unresolved. Report includes event/process ID, tick, actor, exact specimen ID, observed quantity and current source revision, method, viewing conditions, findings with uncertainty, unavailable fields and reasons, and comparison with any personally retained source-linked baseline. An intact covering that blocks inspection supports only 'interior inaccessible by this method; a separate opening/preparation trial is needed to examine it,' not 'must prepare before eating.' Where covering or preparation needs remain unknown, say so. No tasting, consumption, opening, heating, pressing, wetting or sampling is authorized. Any such trial requires a separate explicit action with identified real tools/materials, feasible mechanism and paid conserved work before execution; do not execute or invent that trial here. Input/output conservation: one original specimen remains one original specimen with unchanged quantity, no parts, food, stock or transformed product created; existing ageing continues normally. The only new product is an evidence record, not a certificate. Current decay metadata is neither a visible symptom nor a safety finding. Record code reuse against open.probe/foundation-open@1 and any actual reused runtime components, preserving their original scope; do not claim root or joining mechanics were performed. Encode access, costs, deduplication, interruption and observation limits in executable rules rather than repeated model review. Development/review waiting advances no world time and grants neither mastery nor execution, consent or permission.\\\",\\\"learning\\\":1,\\\"experienceReview\\\":\\\"One personal study round at 0.2 energy, separately initiated and paid; learning, naming, requesting, registration and completion alone award no wellbeing. This precursor supplies no automatic pleasure, satisfaction or comfort. A committed observation that genuinely adds verified, personally applicable information, including an informative access or visibility failure, may be submitted once to the existing evidence-based understanding rule only if that rule is available with executable cap, decay and cooldown; otherwise award zero. Deduplicate by specimen, observed property/state revision and evidence, including equivalent probe observations, not ability name. Repetition of unchanged evidence gives no information-gain award. No new reward schedule or protected-account mutation is authorized. No nutrition, satiety, health or safety benefit follows examination; basic nutrition is not reduced by mood. Physical comfort is not produced and remains capped at 10 under existing rules.\\\",\\\"visualReview\\\":\\\"Keep evidence and functional results separate from presentation. Emit an observable inspection-start event only when actual inspection begins, followed by completed, unavailable or interrupted status matching real execution; a failed or incomplete action cannot display success. Reusable metadata must include component specimen-examination, event/process ID, actor, exact specimen ID, tick, actual location, progress 0/1 or 1/1, status, observed-property references and visibility/uncertainty flags. A completion marker means only the paid examination occurred, never safe, edible, opened or prepared. Render only supported visible exterior details and already exposed interior; unknown content stays occluded and cannot gain an invented kernel, crack or healthy-state image. No persistent world object or duplicate nut is created by an evidence annotation. Detailed findings stay personal unless Lin independently communicates them; nearby actors may perceive actual handling through ordinary visibility, without receiving private findings or mastery. Visuals themselves award no experience.\\\"}]}\"}","annotations":[],"logprobs":[]}],"phase":"final_answer"}],"error":null,"incomplete_details":null,"tools":[],"tool_choice":"auto","parallel_tool_calls":true,"prompt_cache_key":"f4f37934-00c3-4591-8224-e447152752b9","prompt_cache_retention":"24h","text":{"format":{"type":"json_schema","name":"bounded_decision","description":null,"schema":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["queries","result_json"],"properties":{"queries":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"object","additionalProperties":false,"required":["section","search","ids","offset","part"],"properties":{"section":{"type":"string","enum":["abilities","inventory","knowledge","projects","memory","state","observed"]},"search":{"type":"string","maxLength":400},"ids":{"type":"array","maxItems":4,"items":{"type":"string","maxLength":240}},"offset":{"type":"integer","minimum":0},"part":{"type":"integer","minimum":0}}}},"result_json":{"type":["string","null"]}}},"strict":true},"verbosity":"medium"},"top_p":0.98,"top_logprobs":0,"temperature":1.0,"reasoning":{"